**Rest the Kalshi order at Kalshi's own ask.** It is better in every club run: by {{ k.s7.kask_adv_1 }} per fixture at ρ = 1, {{ k.s7.kask_adv_mid }} at ρ = 0.5–0.25, and {{ k.s7.kask_adv_0 }} at ρ = 0. Pricing it at Polymarket's ask instead makes it the best price on Kalshi whenever Polymarket's ask is lower. That wins fills: {{ k.s7.improved_share }} of that variant's Kalshi contracts at ρ = 1. But those fills sell a tick too cheap. The 60-second markout of the Kalshi order is {{ k.s7.mo_k_pmask }} c at Polymarket's ask, against {{ k.s7.mo_k_kask }} c at Kalshi's.

