- **Effect:** {{ k.s7.guard_gain }} per club fixture at ρ = 1–0.25, in every variant.
- **Better bid fills:** it removes the Polymarket bid when Kalshi has already moved below it, and the bid's markout at the fill rises from {{ k.s7.mo_bid_off }} c to {{ k.s7.mo_bid_on }} c per contract.
